                            <li><strong>Decoupled Ingestion Microservice:</strong> Engineered an auxiliary Go microservice communicating via binary gRPC with strict Protocol Buffers contracts to encapsulate ClickHouse, shielding the primary Kotlin/Spring Boot monolith from database driver coupling.</li>
                            <li><strong>Binary Payload Decoupling:</strong> Architected and executed a zero-downtime data migration pipeline extracting legacy binary image blobs out of primary database tables, streaming them to secure Google Cloud Storage (GCS) buckets, and swapping schemas to immutable URIs.</li>
                        </ul>
